#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、またいつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't even wanna think about when he might show up\n"
"on that thing next...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ……
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. ……舞園さん……
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Sayaka."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だめだ、落ち込んでる場合じゃない。
#. 何か…手掛かりは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No! I can't let myself get depressed again! I need to\n"
"search for clues.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ここには、ないよな。
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nothing here..."
msgstr ""

#. ……舞園さん……
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Sayaka."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だめだ、落ち込んでる場合じゃない。
#. 何か…手掛かりは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No! I can't let myself get depressed again! I need to\n"
"search for clues.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ここには、ないよな。
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nothing here..."
msgstr ""

#. ……舞園さん……
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Sayaka."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だめだ、落ち込んでる場合じゃない。
#. 何か…手掛かりはあるか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No! I can't let myself get depressed again! I need to\n"
"search for clues.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>裁縫セットと人体急所マップだけか。
#. これは手掛かりには…ならないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All that's here is the sewing kit and the organ map.\n"
"No useful clues...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か、このゴミ箱の中には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There can only be one thing in the trash can...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…あった。舞園さんに配られたＤＶＤだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yup. The DVD with Sayaka's name on it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. この映像を見た後…
#. 舞園さんは、やたら取り乱してたんだよな…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Sayaka got really upset after seeing whatever was in\n"
"that video."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここには…何が映ってるんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder...what did she see?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件とは直接関係ないかもしれないけど、
#. 確かめておいた方がいいはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It might not be directly related to the case, but it\n"
"might be worth checking out anyway.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さん、ごめん…
#. このＤＶＤを借りてくよ。
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm sorry, Sayaka... I need to borrow this DVD."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さん、ごめん…
#. ＤＶＤを借りてくよ。
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm sorry, Sayaka... I need to borrow this DVD."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この監視カメラで…
#. ボクらが捜査してる姿を見てるって言うのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Whoever's behind this must be using these cameras to\n"
"observe our investigation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな事させて…
#. 一体何が目的なんだよ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To force us into a situation like this... What the\n"
"hell do they want from us!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0022 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0023 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
